<span class="badge badge-info">System Announcement</span>
<h1>New Broadcast Announcement</h1>
<p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
<p>An administrator has broadcasted a new system announcement:</p>

<div class="meta-box">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Title:</td>
      <td class="meta-value"><strong>{{title}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Details:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{message}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Broadcasted By:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{createdBy}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Date:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{date}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>You can view the full list of system announcements in the notification dashboard by clicking the button below:</p>

{{button "Open Notification Dashboard" actionUrl}}

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Regards,<br/>CampusCare IT Administration Team</p>
